# Normalize all text files to LF in both the repo and the working tree.
# CRLF->LF normalization is load-bearing for skillwarden's tamper detection
# (src/core/discovery.ts); the repo must not depend on contributor autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are raw API captures - their byte-exactness is their provenance.
# -text opts them out of ALL eol conversion. Must come after the global rule.
tests/fixtures/** -text
